":"AntiQuarkField, QuarkField, QuarkFieldPsi, QuarkFieldPsiDagger, QuarkFieldChi, QuarkFieldChiDagger - name of a fermionic field","anchor":"basic-objects","section":"Basic objects"},{"text":"CA, CF - Casimir operator eigenvalues of \\(SU(N)\\)","anchor":"basic-objects","section":"Basic objects"},{"text":"CGA, CGS, CGAD, CGSD, CGAE, CGSE - representation of Dirac matrices with Cartesian indices or Dirac matrices contracted to \\(3\\)-momenta","anchor":"basic-objects","section":"Basic objects"},{"text":"CSI, CSID, CSIE, CSIS, CSISD, CSISE - Pauli matrices with Cartesian indices or Pauli matrices contracted to \\(3\\)-momenta","anchor":"basic-objects","section":"Basic objects"},{"text":"CSP, CSPD, CSPE - scalar products of 3-momenta","anchor":"basic-objects","section":"Basic objects"}]